<span class=\"gk\">δόξῃ ἐπίστασθαι, ἡγεῖσθαι,</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">imagine, suppose</b> (wrongly), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.132</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.105</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δόξης ἁμαρτία</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.32</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δόξαι</span> joined with <span class=\"gk\">φαντασίαι,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">161e</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">254a29</span> </span> (but distd. fr. <span class=\"gk\">φαντας&lt;*,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">de An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">428a20</span> </span>); <span class=\"gk\">κατὰ δόξαν,</span> opp. <span class=\"gk\">κατ' οὐσίαν,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">534c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὡς δο&lt;* χρώμενοι</span> speaking <b class=\"lex-tr\">by guess,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.8</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13.8</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">fancy, vision,</b> <span class=\"gk\">δ. ἀκόνας λιγυρᾶς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">O.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.82</sp